<div class="ccp-settings-body">
  <p class="hint">These settings apply to the whole table — only the GM can change them.</p>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Popup Duration: <span id="ccp-duration-output">{{duration}}</span> seconds</label>
    <input type="range" id="ccp-duration-range" name="duration" min="1" max="30" step="1" value="{{duration}}">
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="noTimeout" id="ccp-no-timeout" {{#if noTimeout}}checked{{/if}}> Keep popups on screen with no timeout (ignores duration above — a popup stays until another one replaces it)</label>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Which messages trigger the popup?</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="triggerIC" {{#if triggerIC}}checked{{/if}}> In-character chat</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="triggerEmote" {{#if triggerEmote}}checked{{/if}}> Emotes</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="triggerRolls" {{#if triggerRolls}}checked{{/if}}> Dice rolls</label>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="triggerNPCs" {{#if triggerNPCs}}checked{{/if}}> Also trigger for GM/NPC-spoken messages</label>
  </div>

  <hr>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="bloodiedEnabled" {{#if bloodiedEnabled}}checked{{/if}}> Show a red aura when a character or NPC is bloodied (low HP)</label>
  </div>

  <div class="ccp-bloodied-section">
    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Preview (only visible to you)</label>
      <div class="ccp-preview-box">
        <div class="ccp-preview-thumb ccp-bloodied" id="ccp-bloodied-preview-thumb">
          <img src="{{previewImg}}" alt="Bloodied preview">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Bloodied threshold: <span id="ccp-bloodied-output">{{bloodiedThreshold}}</span>% HP or below</label>
      <input type="range" id="ccp-bloodied-range" name="bloodiedThreshold" min="1" max="99" step="1" value="{{bloodiedThreshold}}">
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="bloodiedAutoPopup" {{#if bloodiedAutoPopup}}checked{{/if}}> Also pop up automatically the instant someone crosses into bloodied (not just when they speak)</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="healAuraEnabled" {{#if healAuraEnabled}}checked{{/if}}> Show a green aura when healed, or gold when revived from 0 HP — both pop up automatically the instant they happen</label>
  </div>

  <div class="ccp-heal-section">
    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Preview (only visible to you)</label>
      <div class="ccp-heal-preview-row">
        <div class="ccp-preview-box ccp-preview-box-small">
          <div class="ccp-preview-thumb ccp-healed" id="ccp-healed-preview-thumb">
            <img src="{{previewImg}}" alt="Healed preview">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ccp-preview-box ccp-preview-box-small">
          <div class="ccp-preview-thumb ccp-revived" id="ccp-revived-preview-thumb">
            <img src="{{previewImg}}" alt="Revived preview">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="hint">Left: green, healed while already conscious. Right: gold, revived from 0 HP.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="hint">Green fires on any HP increase above 0 HP; gold fires only the moment someone goes from 0 HP to above 0. Only one aura shows per heal — a revival always shows gold, never both.</p>
  </div>

  <hr>

  <p class="hint">Want to force a specific look for players, NPCs, or one particular character? That's its own window now — look for <strong>"Configure Character Appearance"</strong> in Game Settings.</p>

  <footer class="form-footer">
    <button type="submit"><i class="fa-solid fa-save"></i> Save</button>
  </footer>
</div>
